  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"cd35cd46-3689-d740-a789-3c19d040da3b"],
 " ",
 "draws each array of the hypermatrix hm as cubes in space, in canonical \
order."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"33cc79d6-3e81-2f4c-911e-7ddcd29e9716"],

Cell["Details and Options", "NotesSection",ExpressionUUID->"57aba7a5-422b-5746-a8c4-c88c4139f0ff"],

Cell["\<\
